@startuml

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Backend
database Database
participant "Ad Server" as AdServer

User -> Frontend: Open app
Frontend -> User: Display question input form

User -> Frontend: Submit question
Frontend -> Backend: Send question

Backend -> Backend: Validate question format
Backend -> Backend: Check usage policy
Backend -> Backend: Standardize question using NLP

Backend -> Database: Query answer

alt Answer found
    Database --> Backend: Answer
    Backend --> Frontend: Return answer

else Answer not found
    Database --> Backend: No answer found
    Backend --> Frontend: "Hmmm... Let me think about it.\nAsk me again in 24 hours."
    Backend -> Database: Save unanswered question
end

Frontend -> AdServer: Request advertisement
AdServer --> Frontend: Advertisement

Frontend --> User: Display response and advertisement

note over Backend,Database
Human editors periodically review
unanswered questions, research
answers, and store them in the database.
end note

@enduml